			"text":"Ufff",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1560,
			"y":1100,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a69cf00328beff3a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[Spiritfarer](https://app.sensortower.com/vgi/game/spiritfarer-farewell-edition)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":1080,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8f14555dd4765bc3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Offer a (false) plan for an impossible situation \n\n(How to build your bunker guide)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1120,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"f65447d0b5795506",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Creatures",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":1160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"613e58c0f4ee9010",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Religion is helpful bc it gives clear instructions and sense of agency/order to traumatic events?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1200,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"47ac10f1ef8d89d9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**How much do you need to do, and what to be a “good person”**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":1220,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"f2f49b50fe13d130",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Terrorists dwelling caves**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":1180,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0314927151f297d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Should do Floorplan only Layout test for Bunker (been overinvesting on detail)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":800,
			"y":1180,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"bb45b603d8ee9268",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Make Canvas for Trait notes overview",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1240,
			"y":1180,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c21772c711c77d29",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Re-Set PC? Lots of Hassle but should do eventually anyway?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1600,
			"y":1180,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"869d142a688edb7d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Is Greek tragedy\nIt’s oedipus from the perspective of the father\n\nIt’s cronos \nDevouring child-> April watching younger self consumed, Daryl huge, eyes wide open, caught in the act, afraid",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":1260,
			"width":260,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"a9b59c6aebf7bbe2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Make \"#currentTrait\" tag for doc?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1240,
			"y":1260,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"d8ec9838fd65863d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Check Steam Lib Compatibility w/ Linux",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1600,
			"y":1260,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1ea7221e1bc425f4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Beauty",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"3af7d376ab7e2b7c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Cat:\nFamily themes resonate strongly\n\nConflict between mother and father very relatable\n\nSibling bond between April and June\n\nSees her as idol, frustration she can’t be the same\n\nCharacters have their own lives -> wants to feel that for them",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2360,
			"y":-360,
			"width":260,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"59d84d9b1c1f4ff8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Eschatology\nStudy of last things",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":1340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a47e2753e3d0a460",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Our politics don’t dictate how susceptible we are to propaganda",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":1420,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"01d218d1a34e4db4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**rhetorical slight of hand**\nNot always. Not even usually. But sometimes.\n\nExploration and dissection of my own flaws.\n\nResponsibilities in family matters.\n\nYou can’t put all the blame on me, you’re your own person.\n\nWhen that’s not even what’s said.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":1420,
			"width":260,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"b67a36c586832106",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Feedback",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2400,
			"y":-440,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9958755fb81f0f1f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Blocks",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2020,
			"y":1500,
